== Style pass (2026-10-15) ==
=== Marginal cuts ===
* Removed the Sources list. The Collecting Encyclopedia 3.2 is already cited inline. These three were not cited on any sentence:
** [https://www.starwarsccg.org/collecting/ SWCCG Collecting Encyclopedia] at starwarsccg.org
** [https://web.archive.org/web/20081225225012/http://www.decipher.com/starwars/cardlists/index.html Star Wars CCG cardlists] at Decipher.com (archive, 25 December 2008)
** [https://starwars.fandom.com/wiki/Reflections_II Reflections II] at Wookieepedia
* Lead: cut the repeated box-topper titles (listed under Box toppers) and "CardGuide numbering: 28th product." (repeats "28th Star Wars CCG product").
